   * 2. Validate request body:
   *    - title: required, 1-500 characters
   *    - description: optional, 0-2000 characters
   *    - startDate: optional, must be valid datetime if provided
   *    - dueDate: optional, must be valid datetime if provided
   *    - Validate startDate <= dueDate if both provided
   * 3. Create todo record:
   *    - Set todo_app_member_id from authenticated session
   *    - Set title, description, startDate, dueDate from request
   *    - Set completed = false (default)
   *    - Set created_at = updated_at = current timestamp
   *    - Generate UUID for id
